# Task Master Rule

## Trigger
Applies when a scoped task/checklist item is completed.

## Actions
1. Mark task as done in tasklist/plan.
2. Update `memory_bank/progress.md`.
3. If process/architecture changed, add ADR entry to `memory_bank/decisions.md`.
4. Suggest a concise commit message.
